Well, I've found that they have two useful modes of operation. The first is 
the "drop them on my enemy" (Good for blessed scrolls) mode which is what 
you would want. Bees are weak (1 HD) and the bonk on the head will proably 
kill a good number of them. The other way to use them is the "stick 
bounders in your enemies way" (Good for uncured and cursed scrolls) read 
the scroll in a narrow area and then run away from your enemy, the boulder 
that is left where you were standing should stop them (don't try this trick 
with things that can walk past boulders).

